{"id":"wb-5-267","name":"西溪二仙庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"西溪二仙庙","text":"西溪二仙庙是位于中华人民共和国山西省晋城市陵川县崇文镇西溪景区山谷中的一座祠庙，又称真泽宫，为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。西溪二仙庙背水面山，选址不同于传统，庙内松林葱郁，环境清幽，“西溪春色”为陵川古八景之一。\n西溪二仙庙属于在晋东南颇为流行的二仙信仰，是真泽二仙宫外最主要的二仙祠庙。庙内供奉以孝感天的乐氏二姐妹冲惠、冲淑二真人，有“隆冬采菇”、“捡麦升仙”等故事，香火很旺。每年四月十五相传为二仙升天之日，庙内会举办庙会，戏台演剧，香客云集。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%A5%BF%E6%BA%AA%E4%BA%8C%E4%BB%99%E5%BA%99","revisionId":94549186,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94549186","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b3099565132e19253550c27e.jpg","title":"20260725_Xixi_Erxian_Temple_05.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260725_Xixi_Erxian_Temple_05.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b6/20260725_Xixi_Erxian_Temple_05.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​晋城陵川 西溪二仙庙","width":320,"height":213}}